sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as Caller / MultiTierEvaluator
    participant NStore as HilbertNeighborStore
    participant KeyGen as HilbertKeyGenerator (hilbert_rs)
    participant Lead as LeadStore (GrpcLeadStore)
    participant Euclid as EuclideanDistance

    Note over Caller,Lead: 1. Concurrent Multi-Probe Store (3 rotated curves)
    Caller->>NStore: store(genes, fitness, generation)
    NStore->>NStore: serde_json::to_string(&GenePayload)
    NStore->>KeyGen: keys_for(genes)
    KeyGen-->>NStore: [key_curve0, key_curve1, key_curve2]
    
    par Concurrent Store Fanout (try_join_all)
        NStore->>Lead: store_gene(key_curve0, value)
        NStore->>Lead: store_gene(key_curve1, value)
        NStore->>Lead: store_gene(key_curve2, value)
    end
    Lead-->>NStore: all Ok(())
    NStore-->>Caller: Ok(())

    Note over Caller,Euclid: 2. Concurrent Multi-Probe k-NN Query & Euclidean Re-ranking
    Caller->>NStore: query_knn(query, k)
    NStore->>KeyGen: keys_for(query)
    KeyGen-->>NStore: [probe_curve0, probe_curve1, probe_curve2]

    par Concurrent Range Query Fanout (join_all)
        NStore->>Lead: range_query(probe_curve0, k)
        NStore->>Lead: range_query(probe_curve1, k)
        NStore->>Lead: range_query(probe_curve2, k)
    end
    Lead-->>NStore: candidate slices from all curves

    NStore->>NStore: deduplicate by key into candidate HashMap
    loop For each candidate in map
        NStore->>Euclid: distance(query, &candidate.genes)
        Euclid-->>NStore: distance f64
    end
    NStore->>NStore: sort candidates ascending by true Euclidean distance
    NStore->>NStore: take top k candidates
    NStore-->>Caller: Ok(Vec<GenePayload>)
